        "code": "import random\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef sample(logits, count=1000, seed=7,\n           temperature=1.0):\n    rng = random.Random(seed)\n    return dict(Counter(rng.choices(\n        range(len(logits)),\n        probabilities(logits, temperature),\n        k=count)))",
